00:33:23,041 --> 00:33:33,900
old friends but there's no time to loiter let's go we gotta run one stop

475
00:33:33,901 --> 00:33:40,980
every 15 minutes then the duo starts all over again repeating the route for lunch

476
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:51,640
With every move, Alfredo and Graciela have to shut everything down and secure it all before setting it up all over again at the next job site.

477
00:33:54,820 --> 00:33:56,160
18 stops.

478
00:33:57,200 --> 00:33:59,040
100 carne asadas and burritos.

