00:34:08,721 --> 00:34:19,040
We're just gonna go ahead, go back to the company, respect the truck, clean the truck,

482
00:34:19,041 --> 00:34:22,680
do the dishwashing and reload the sodas.

483
00:34:22,681 --> 00:34:23,680
Let's go!

