00:35:33,580 --> 00:35:37,160
To young hungry guys, as they say, 18 to 34-year-olds.

506
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:39,840
They seem to love it when they see the trucks come in.

507
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:45,254
35 feet in length, the truck is a miniature version of a Carl's Jr.

508
00:35:45,255 --> 00:35:47,400
drive-in, including the kitchen.

